SHIPPED — what exists on the product path

File: openOODA/SHIPPED.oot
This is what we have proved. DESIGN is the want. Residual is wanted, not built.

Proof for this file means: files on disk under ooda/, plus oodac check oodac/main.oo,
or a fixture/smoke that emit-c + gcc + runs. Source under std/src/ooda is not that proof.

Proven

  Compiler
    oodac check of oodac/main.oo. Live pin is on SPRINT.oot (v0.198.0-alpha).
    C emit through chs_rt, then gcc. That is the product path.
    Official rebuild is bootstrap/oodac_pure_build (host bash, gcc+seed).
    scripts/oodac_pure_build.sh is gone. Do not call it.
    Type checker: oodac/tc_*.oo. Typestate: oodac/check_typestate*.oo.
    requires / ensures: oodac/tc_refine*.oo and contract fixtures.
    SECRET sinks include process_exec. Fail fixture refuses SECRET token.
    ooda run is check + emit C + gcc + exec. Proved on fixtures/hello.oo.
    LLVM hello on a seed-emitted host: emit-llvm + clang + run prints the hello line.
    Slim two-stage (~0.31 GiB) and check-under-10s are Open 2 (other writer).

  Caps
    Process-local tokens, not OS Landlock.
    sys_spawn / sys_wait / sys_kill are real (fork, waitpid, kill).
    Proved: fixtures/sys_spawn_wait.oo prints ok. kill pid 0 is refused.
    Spawn and exec children share oo_child_filter_env: OODA_/OO_ keys only,
    then PATH=/usr/bin:/bin. HOME does not leak. fixtures/sys_spawn_env.oo.
    process_exec is sh -c and a SECRET sink.
    GpuCap is CPU/noop. Device shaders are not product.

  Library and tools
    ooda/std includes std/core/list.oo. fixtures/std_list_main.oo prints 1 then 2.
    ooda/pm exists. vscode talks to vscode/server/ooda-lsp.js.

Residual (wanted, not built)

  WASM: emit is .wat unless Open 2 ships a real .wasm. wasmtime is not required.
  LLVM match / contracts / SECRET refuse vs Backend-C: Open 2 (other writer).
  Hello LLVM is proved on seed-emitted host only. Do not also call it residual.
  HITL path-A is pause deny + verify_human. Interactive approve/deny is Open 5.
  Marker fuzz (int/bool/string/list) is In. Mixed-type smoke under std/src is
  not product proof. std/src/ooda is not product.
  DNS / import C / Landlock / heap rlimit / HMAC seals / TPM / cgroups later.
  ooda/pm install, native LSP, ooda fix E_CAP: see SPRINT Closed; do not re-open
  here without a new fail.
  SoA/DoD, AST macros, extra typestate, actors, hot-swap, bit-identical,
  merkle/undo/EBR, GPU device, bare metal are later.
